  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till SIWI avs.verksamheten inom International Center for Water Cooperation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to SIWI for activities within International Center for Water Cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det till SIWI avs. verksamheten inom ICWC i enlighet med det ing&#xe5;ngna trepartsavtalet mellan Unesco, SIWI och Sveriges regering. St&#xf6;det uppg&#xe5;r till sammanlagt 12 000 000 kronor f&#xf6;r perioden 2021&#x2013;2026 med en &#xe5;rlig utbetalning om 2 miljoner kronor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activities focus on international cooperation and sustainable management of water resources and constitute an important part of the work on sustainability in the use and management of water resources within the framework of Agenda 2030 and development cooperation in low- and middle-income countries (developing countries).</narrative>
  </description>
